tifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/RetryByCountStrategy","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent20RetryByCountStrategyC"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Equatable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SQ"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Error","preciseIdentifier":"s:s5ErrorP"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The maximum number of times to retry the upstream, defaulting to 1.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"retries"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The specific error that should trigger a retry."}]}],"name":"error"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncSequence"},{"type":"text","text":" that emits the same output as the upstream but retries on the specified error up to the specified number of times."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method returns an "},{"code":"AsyncSequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" that retries the upstream only when the specified error occurs, up to the given number of retries."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Not all "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncSequence"},{"type":"text","text":"s can be retried. For example, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncStream"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncThrowingStream"},{"type":"text","text":" cannot be retried on their own."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"